# Build context exclusions — anything that doesn't belong in the image.
# Use **/ for nested matches: bare `node_modules` only matches top-level,
# missing apps/*/node_modules and packages/*/node_modules. When those leak
# into the context they overwrite the container's bun-install symlinks with
# Windows-host absolute paths (E:/...), breaking vite/svelte-kit at build time.
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.md
!**/Dockerfile
.code-review-graph
postgres-data
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
oauth-tokens.json
.bexio-tokens.json
mockups-tmp
